# livery-package check (SPEC-livery-package criterion 7): reload the save fh1-livery-car-buy left and
# drive car 3001 again. Seed: that run's private state folder (<output>.state, e.g.
# .local\render-tests\fh1-livery-car-buy.state); the runner copies it again, so it is not written.
# The player spawns outside the Autoshow in car 3001.
# The native DLC trace logs the title's entitlement and rows for car 3001 and the stock car:
# dlc-car-trace
# dlc-car-ids 3001,1557
# In free roam the throttle is held until the car has moved 15 m, then the camera turns to each side
# (drive-rear, look-right, look-left, look-back).
